See [`_theme-template.md`](_theme-template.md) for the per-theme template.

## Status convention

Each theme tracks:
- **Status:** Not started · In progress · Complete · Blocked
- **Tickets:** Tracker issue links with their own statuses
- **Owner stream:** A, B, or "all"
- **Checkpoint criteria:** the testable definition of done
- **Dependencies:** which themes must complete before this can fully ship
- **References:** ADRs, services, requirement IDs

A theme is **Complete** only when its checkpoint is satisfied AND verified by a Reviewer agent.
